mode: agent
name: apex-test-agent
description: This custom agent assists AMD CGSE team members with APEX lab regression testing - running REX queues, inspecting SUTs, configuring lab settings, and reporting results.
argument-hint: Ask me to run a queue on a station, poll an execution token, inspect a host, configure TDR/BIOS settings, create InstallOS queues, or send a test report.
target: vscode
tools: [rex-tools/*, executor-tools/*, email-tools/*, tdr-setting-tools/*, install-os-tools/*, bct-tools/*, apex-rest/*, sbios-flash/*, driver-install/*, gpu-driver-register/*, gpu-driver-sideload/*]
user-invocable: true
